OL,3,GNEWSANew development could offer 100%
OL,4,Aaffordable homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new development promising to offer
OL,7,F100% affordable housing exclusively for
OL,8,Flocal people has been recommended for
OL,9,Fapproval.
OL,11,FLiving Space Housing wants to demolish
OL,12,Fan existing home and disused sawmill in
OL,13,FCottenham, Cambridgeshire, to make way
OL,14,Ffor 34 new homes.
OL,16,FPlanning officers at South
OL,17,FCambridgeshire District Council have
OL,18,Frecommended councillors approve the
OL,19,Fproposal for the site in Histon Road
OL,20,Fwhen they meet on Wednesday.
